saction Description":"IGF::CT::IGF CRITICAL FUNCTIONS THIRD PARTY DATA- SKIP TRACING SUPPORT","generated_internal_id":"CONT_AWD_TFSAFSA15C0014_2036_-NONE-_-NONE-","internal_id":343568692},{"Award ID":"0021","Recipient Name":"PENNSLYVANIA HIGHER EDUCATION ASSISTANCE AGENCY","Transaction Amount":277102.5,"Action Date":"2017-09-26","Mod":"5","Awarding Sub Agency":"Department of Education","naics_code":"522390","Transaction Description":"IGF::CT::IGF CRITICAL FUNCTION  BASE AWARD: SERVICING OF TITLE IV STUDENT FINANCIAL AID, IN ACCORDANCE WITH SECTION 2212 OF THE HEALTH CARE AND EDUCATION RECONCILIATION ACT OF 2010 (PUB.L. 111-152, 124 STAT. 1029) FOR THE PERIOD OF 6/17/2009 TO 6/16/2019.  TASK ORDER: SERVICING OF TITLE IV STUDENT FINANCIAL AID IN ACCORDANCE WITH SECTION 2212 OF THE HEALTH CARE AND EDUCATION RECONCILIATION ACT OF 2010 (PUB.L.111-152, 124 STAT. 1029) FOR THE PERIOD OF 9/1/2017 TO 8/31/2018.  MODIFICATION: THE PURPOSE OF THIS MODIFICATION IS TO PROVIDE FUNDING FOR CHANGE REQUESTS. IN ACCORDANCE WITH CHANGE REQUEST 3562, SERVICERS SHALL MAKE NECESSARY SYSTEM AND/OR PROCESSING ADJUSTMENTS TO MAKE THE PAPER FORMS FOR BORROWERS AVAILABLE VIA WEBSITES. IN ACCORDANCE WITH CHANGE REQUEST 3955, SERVICERS SHALL DO THE FOLLOWING: 1. COMPARE THE NSLDS FILE (OF VETERANS WHO ARE TOTALLY AND PERMANENTLY DISABLED) TO BORROWERS EXISTING ON THE METASTORM SYSTEM TO COMPLETE ANY MISSING VA INFORMATION, 2. CREATE A REVIEW PROTOCOL AND A NEW DISCHARGE TYPE BASED ON VA MATCH, 3. CREATE A NEW TYPE OF STATUS ON THE LHN TO DIFFERENTIATE BETWEEN VA DISCHARGE AND VA MATCH DISCHARGE, 4. CREATE LETTERS SIMILAR TO THOSE FOR THE SSA MATCH, BUT TARGETED TOWARD VETERANS, 5. SEND AN INITIAL NOTIFICATION TO THE BORROWER AND AGAIN AFTER 120 IF NO RESPONSE, 6. CREATE A QUARTERLY REPORT OF THE NUMBER OF BORROWERS MATCHED, APPLICATION RECEIVED, ETC, AND WILL CONTINUE USING THE LOAN TABLE CREATED IN CR 3700 TO EXCLUDE LOANS FOR VA MATCH, AND 7. PROVIDE UPFRONT VENDOR OUTREACH TO OBTAIN VALID ADDRESSES WHEN NEEDED AND PROVIDE SKIP TRACING ACTIVITIES FOR RETURNED MAIL. NON-TPD SERVICERS WILL DISCHARGE LOANS OR PUT BORROWERS ON ADMIN FORBEARANCE AS DIRECTED BY THE TPD SERVICER, REPORT DISCHARGED LOANS TO CREDIT BUREAUS, \"CLEAR UP\" NEGATIVE REPORTING AFTER THE DISABILITY DATE, AND SEND 1099S TO BORROWERS WHOSE LOANS HAVE BEEN DISCHARGED. IN ACCORDANCE WITH CHANGE REQUEST 4174, SERVICERS SHALL IMPLEMENT THE UPDATED GUIDELINES FOR BORROWER DEFENSE DISCHARGES FOR CERTAIN SCHOOLS THAT SHOULD NOT RESULT IN THE DISCHARGE BEING CONSIDERED TAXABLE INCOME. THUS, THE BORROWER AND IRS SHOULD NOT RECEIVE A 1099 RELATED TO THE DISCHARGE. THE SERVICERS SHALL CREATE A PROCESS THAT ALIGNS TO FSA'S REQUIREMENTS.","generated_internal_id":"CONT_AWD_0021_9100_EDFSA09D0014_9100","internal_id":273322814},{"Award ID":"HHSP233201700328G","Recipient Name":"DEVAL , LLC","Transaction Amount":120000.0,"Action Date":"2017-09-27","Mod":"0","Awarding Sub Agency":"Office of the Assistant Secretary for Administration","naics_code":"541611","Transaction Description":"IGF::OT::IGF SKIP-TRACING SERVICES","generated_internal_id":"CONT_AWD_HHSP233201700328G_7570_GS23F003BA_4732","internal_id":307155739},{"Award ID":"AG31MED170008","Recipient Name":"EXPERIAN INFORMATION SOLUTIONS, INC.","Transaction Amount":10000.0,"Action Date":"2018-02-12","Mod":"1","Awarding Sub Agency":"Rural Housing Service","naics_code":"561450","Transaction Description":"IGF::OT::IGF EXPERIAN SKIP TRACING/LOCATOR PRODUCTS&SERVICES, USDA, RD, CSC, ST. LOUIS, MO","generated_internal_id":"CONT_AWD_AG31MED170008_12E3_GS23F0356P_4730","internal_id":292620163},{"Award ID":"TFMSHQ11K0005","Recipient Name":"DATA & ANALYTIC SOLUTIONS INC","Transaction Amount":-407940.88,"Action Date":"2018-08-20","Mod":"14","Awarding Sub Agency":"Bureau of the Fiscal Service","naics_code":"541519","Transaction Description":"SKIP TRACING SERVICES IGF::OT::IGF FOR OTHER FUNCTIONS","generated_internal_id":"CONT_AWD_TFMSHQ11K0005_2036_GS35F0135S_4730"